ee available wildcards</li>\\n<li>Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter → inserts <code>__wildcard_name__</code></li>\\n<li>Auto-show options → immediately displays all options from that wildcard</li>\\n<li>Select an option and press Enter → replaces wildcard with chosen option</li>\\n<li>ESC → keeps inserted wildcard and closes options</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>🌟 <b>Features</b></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Smart parsing: wildcards with complex paths (e.g. <code>__pmp/blwjob/blwjb__</code>)</li>\\n<li>Line-by-line options: each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option</li>\\n<li>Text overflow handling: long options truncated with hover expansion</li>\\n<li>Full compatibility with existing wildcard files and formats</li>\\n<li>Multiple sources: repository, ComfyUI/models and DynamicPrompts</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>📁 <b>Wildcard Sources</b> (in priority order):</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Repository wildcards/ folder</li>\\n<li>ComfyUI models/wildcards/</li>\\n<li>ComfyUI custom_nodes/wildcards/</li>\\n<li>DynamicPrompts wildcards/</li>\\n<li>Extra model paths configuration</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p><i>This extension is based on ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts.</i></p>\\n<hr>\\n\\n<h2>📁 Manual Wildcard Setup (Optional)</h2>\\n<p>To use wildcards with Easy-Use you may need to copy the wildcards folder:</p>\\n<pre>cp -r /path/to/ComfyUI-TagForge/wildcards \\\\\\n    /path/to/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Easy-Use/wildcards/</pre>\\n<p>Then <b>restart ComfyUI</b> to load the new wildcards.</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":517.0199082421873,\"height\":814.8184835546876}"
